        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7GhhQJ0OeCJxHcRvye5HZVWDpgQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/153205-butternut-squash-fries-step-02-bc18cac2df7d48d8822535a577f98bfd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/153205/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blot any moisture from the butternut squash fries with paper towels, then arrange squash pieces on a baking sheet. Season with salt.",
